---
import Info from "../cards/Info.astro";
import Container from "../shared/Container.astro";
import Paragraph from "../shared/Paragraph.astro";
import Title from "../shared/Title.astro";

---

<section id="about-us" class="scroll-animation">
    <Container className="flex flex-col midmd:flex-row gap-10 lg:gap-12">
        <div class="max-w-md mx-auto midmd:max-w-none lg:mx-0  lg:pr-10 xl:pr-2 flex-1 flex w-11/12 midmd:w-5/12 lg:w-1/2 midmd:h-auto">
            <div class="w-full h-80 sm:h-96 midmd:h-full relative">
                <div class="absolute rotate-45 -left-5 md:-left-10 lg:-left-20 xl:-left-24 p-1 top-1/2 w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-orange-400 blur-3xl opacity-50"></div>
                <div class="absolute  p-1 -top-4 md:-top-10 right-0 w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-orange-400 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60"></div>
                
                <span class="absolute w-full aspect-[16/5] -skew-x-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-primary to-green-400 opacity-40 blur-2xl left-0 bottom-0"></span>
               
                            <img src={`${Astro.site}/images/ashishp1.jpeg`} alt="Hero image" width="2350" height="2359" class="  w-auto left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 absolute bottom-0 max-h-full lg:absolute lg:w-full lg:h-full rounded-3xl object-cover lg:max-h-none max-h-96">

        </div>
            </div>
        <div class="flex-1 flex midmd:w-7/12 lg:w-1/2 flex-col">
            <Title>
                About
            </Title>
            <Paragraph className="mt-8">
                Hello! I’m Ashish Jha, and I love building efficient, scalable web applications that solve real-world problems. My journey into web development started with a curiosity for how dynamic websites work, and I’ve been exploring, learning, and creating ever since.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph className="mt-4">
                Fast forward to today, I’ve had the opportunity to work across various industries, contributing to projects at startups, enterprises, and tech-driven teams. Currently, my focus is on crafting high-performance, backend-efficient systems and full-stack solutions that prioritize both user experience and technical robustness.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph className="mt-4">
                I recently worked on building full-stack applications, leveraging the power of Angular and Spring Boot to deliver seamless, data-driven products. I’m constantly expanding my skill set and adapting to new technologies to stay ahead in this fast-evolving field.
            </Paragraph>
        </div>
    </Container>
</section>
